  {
    "key": "about.p1",
    "namespace": "about",
    "translations": {
      "en": "I'm a backend-leaning full-stack engineer with 5+ years shipping production systems — from ride-hailing platforms serving thousands of users to delivery apps, internal tools and open-source libraries. As Tech Lead at TUTU I led an 8-person team, owning architecture, code quality and delivery.",
      "es": "Soy un ingeniero full-stack con base en backend, con 5+ años enviando sistemas a producción — desde plataformas de movilidad para miles de usuarios hasta apps de delivery, herramientas internas y librerías open-source. Como Tech Lead en TUTU lideré un equipo de 8 personas, manejando arquitectura, calidad de código y entregas."
    },
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-07T22:34:58.053Z"
  },
  {
    "key": "about.p2End",
    "namespace": "about",
    "translations": {
      "en": " — building services that are easy to reason about and scale. I also run ",
      "es": " — armar servicios fáciles de razonar y escalar. También llevo adelante "
